      "refersTo": "mail-unread",
      "description": "A slim edge and stronger type mark new mail.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-mail\"><a class=\"ds-mail-link\" href=\"#message\" aria-label=\"Unread: Ada Chen, Domain renewal\"><span>Ada Chen</span><time datetime=\"09:41\">09:41</time><span class=\"ds-subject\">Domain renewal</span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-mail{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:0 .75rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 42%,var(--main));transition:background-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-mail:is(:hover,:focus-within){background:var(--accent)}.ds-mail-link{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.25rem .75rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.75rem 0;color:var(--foreground);text-decoration:none;font:600 .875rem/1.25rem \"Inter Variable\",sans-serif}.ds-mail-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-mail time{color:var(--muted-foreground);text-align:right;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:400;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-subject{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}@media(min-width:40rem){.ds-mail{padding:0 1.5rem}.ds-mail-link{grid-template-columns:minmax(8rem,.7fr) minmax(0,1.6fr) 6.5rem;column-gap:1.25rem}.ds-subject{grid-column:2;grid-row:1}.ds-mail time{grid-column:3;grid-row:1}}"
    }
